  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of food assistance and specialized nutrition commodities to prevent the risk of famine while making a more lasting impact on household food security areas projected to face the worst levels of food insecurity.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide food and nutrition assistance to vulnerable people affected by food insecurity in South Sudan. This WFP project provides in-kind and in-cash food assistance, and it screens and treats people for moderate and severe malnutrition. The project provides life-saving humanitarian assistance to 101,358 people in the Food Security sector and 35,090 people in the Nutrition sector.</narrative>
  </description>
